                                                "example_id": "4b3f2f77-757c-4a32-a13a-a4db58a24003",
                                                "sense_id": "3e6d0f73-8559-33c0-afcf-5afa080adb20",
                                                "text": "The reason is that the Berks & Hants Railway Company, under the powers of which the line was built, also included the Reading-Basingstoke section. The company was an offshoot of the G.W.R., which absorbed it before any section was opened."
